  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Kids T-Shirt is designed with comfort and durability in mind, making it perfect for active children. Constructed from a super soft and breathable cotton / polyester blend, this short sleeve shirt ensures your child stays comfortable throughout the day. The fabric blend combines the softness of cotton with the strength and quick-drying properties of polyester, ideal for various activities. The tag-less label enhances comfort by preventing irritation, making this crew neck shirt perfect for extended wear.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
