  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Kids T-Shirt is designed with comfort and durability in mind, making it perfect for active children. Constructed from a super soft and breathable cotton / polyester blend, this short sleeve shirt ensures your child stays comfortable throughout the day. The fabric blend combines the softness of cotton with the strength and quick-drying properties of polyester, ideal for various activities. The tag-less label enhances comfort by preventing irritation, making this crew neck shirt perfect for extended wear. Rothco's Kids T-Shirt is an excellent choice for screen printing, allowing you to customize it with your own designs. It's also great for outdoor games and adventures. Available in a variety of colors inspired by classic designs, this t-shirt offers both style and practicality. Rothco&rsquo;s commitment to quality ensures that this shirt will withstand the rigors of play and maintain its softness and shape wash after wash.</p>",
